cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "DLOFeel-State: physics-informed tactile-based shape estimation of deformable linear objects"
abstract: >-
  Tactile-primary global shape estimation for deformable linear objects (DLOs).
  A physics-informed vision-transformer framework maps four DIGIT tactile images
  and the 7-D end-effector pose to a 3-D vertex chain, without visual input.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rotematari/dlofeel-state"
keywords:
  - deformable linear objects
  - tactile sensing
  - shape estimation
  - robotic manipulation
  - physics-informed learning
authors:
